{"k":{"t01-apar-0":"<span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"12.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">VERKLARENDE HANDLEIDING</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"8.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">BY</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">die Delmas-hulptabelle</span> <span class=\"orn\">❦</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"serio\">EERSTE REEKS</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"nom\">TABEL Nr. 1</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"tit\">Die skool, die liseum, die klaskamer.</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Algemene beskrywing.</span>","t01-01-1":"1. — Hierdie tabel stel ’n <b>klaskamer</b> in ’n <b>liseum</b> voor. In hierdie klaskamer staan agt <b>tafels</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.339325,0.560105,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"tafels\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> en agt <b>banke</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.298491,0.886341,0.009543,0.012447\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"banke\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button>. Op elke bank sit drie leerlinge. Die <b>onderwyser</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.104527,0.503767,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"onderwyser\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> sit op ’n <b>stoel</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.072792,0.542745,0.00466,0.012119\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"stoel\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button> by sy <b>kateder</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.134043,0.602358,0.00466,0.011137\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"kateder\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button>.","t01-02-1":"2. — Links van die kateder staan ’n <b>kas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"kas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> met <b>glasdeure</b>. Regs is die <b>swartbord</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.016644,0.59679,0.003329,0.010481\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"swartbord\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button> met die <b>spons</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.034842,0.685228,0.005548,0.010154\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"spons\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button> en die <b>kryt</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.055704,0.744186,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"kryt\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button>.","t01-02-2":"Bo die kateder hang <b>muurplate</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.042166,0.4887,0.00466,0.010481\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"muurplate\" aria-expanded=\"false\">9</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"muurplate\" aria-expanded=\"false\">11</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"muurplate\" aria-expanded=\"false\">12</button>)</sup> en ’n <b>kaart</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.117843,0.250901,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"kaart\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button>.","t01-03-1":"3. — Nie al die leerlinge sit op hulle <b>plek</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.290945,0.528005,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"plek\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button> nie. Jan <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.006658,0.712414,0.00577,0.010481\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button> staan by die bord, hy hou die spons vas en vee die <b>meetkundige figure</b> uit.","t01-03-2":"Pieter is naby die kateder, hy versamel die <b>skryfwerk</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.092543,0.64756,0.005104,0.010809\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"skryfwerk\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button> en bring dit na die onderwyser toe.","t01-04-1":"4. — Hierdie onderwyser is die onderwyser van die <b>lewende tale</b>. Hy leer die leerlinge om vreemde tale te praat, te lees en te skryf <b>(Duits, Engels, Spaans, Italiaans, Russies</b> of <b>Frans)</b>.","t01-05-1":"5. — Die klaskamer is baie ruim en baie helder. Agterin is ’n breë <b>venster</b> met twee <b>boligte</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.336662,0.236489,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"78\" title=\"boligte\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(78)</sup></button> en die <b>glasdeur</b> om dit te lug en te verlig.","t01-05-2":"Hierdie klaskamer is nie koud nie. In die middel staan daar, om dit te verwarm, ’n baie goeie <b>stoof</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543054,0.73567,0.011984,0.010809\" data-n=\"46\" title=\"stoof\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(46)</sup></button> met sy <b>pyp</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.506214,0.622666,0.010431,0.011464\" data-n=\"45\" title=\"pyp\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(45)</sup></button>.","t01-05-3":"Teen die muur is <b>kapstokhake</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.908566,0.720275,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"58\" title=\"kapstokhake\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(58)</sup></button> vasgemaak, daaraan hang die pette en die jasse van die skoliere.","t01-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Die speelplek</span>","t01-06-1":"6. — Die <b>horlosie</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.781846,0.21225,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"63\" title=\"horlosie\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(63)</sup></button> wys vyf minute oor nege.","t01-06-2":"Die <b>pouse</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.38016,0.384212,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"76\" title=\"pouse\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(76)</sup></button> het pas geëindig en die les begin weer. Die speelruimte lê op die <b>binnehof</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.36285,0.442516,0.008655,0.010154\" data-n=\"75\" title=\"binnehof\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(75)</sup></button>. Ons sien ’n paar leerlinge wat speel. ’n <b>Ondermeester</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.419441,0.372093,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"74\" title=\"Ondermeester\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(74)</sup></button> hou toesig oor hulle.","t01-07-1":"7. — Op die binnehof sien ons boonop verskillende persone, naamlik die <b>inspekteur</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.400355,0.432689,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"73\" title=\"inspekteur\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(73)</sup></button>, die skoolhoof <b>(rektor)</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.47692,0.431379,0.008655,0.010809\" data-n=\"71\" title=\"(rektor)\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(71)</sup></button> en die <b>sensor</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.441411,0.428431,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"72\" title=\"sensor\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(72)</sup></button>.","t01-07-2":"Die inspekteur inspekteer die skole, die rektor lei die liseum, die sensor hou toesig oor die studies.","t01-07-3":"Die vierde persoon is die <b>portier</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.33644,0.429414,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"77\" title=\"portier\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(77)</sup></button>. Hy dra ’n register onder sy arm om die afwesiges in te skryf.","t01-08-1":"8. — Agterin die binnehof staan die <b>gimnastiektoestelle</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.467599,0.393384,0.009543,0.009826\" data-n=\"70\" title=\"gimnastiektoestelle\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(70)</sup></button> en die werkplek vir die <b>handearbeid</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"handearbeid\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>.","t01-08-2":"Regs van die tabel begin ons die <b>lokale</b> vir <b>musiek</b> en <b>tekene</b> sien.","t01-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Uitvoerige beskrywing.</span>","t01-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Die goeie leerlinge.</span>","t01-09-1":"9. — Die leerlinge van die eerste bank regs van die kateder is <b>Hendrik</b> <button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"af-t01-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>, <b>Stefanus</b> en <b>Karel</b>.","t01-09-2":"Hendrik is baie oplettend en werksaam, hy luister na die onderwyser. Op sy tafel het hy ’n <b>skrif</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230581,0.868981,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"skrif\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>, ’n <b>boek</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.199068,0.863085,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"boek\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>, ’n <b>woordeboek</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.159565,0.891582,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"woordeboek\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button> en ’n <b>pennehouer</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.214603,0.905011,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"pennehouer\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button>. Sy boek het baie <b>bladsye</b>, elke hoofstuk bevat verskeie <b>paragrawe</b> en elke <b>reël</b> baie <b>woorde</b>.","t01-09-4":"Sy buurman Stefanus <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.291389,0.81035,0.012206,0.010154\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button> is ywerig. Hy skryf in sy skrif die les vir die volgende keer aan. Hy het ’n mooi <b>handskrif</b>. Sy boek is toe. Ons sien net die <b>omslag</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.201287,0.804455,0.010431,0.010809\" data-n=\"27\" title=\"omslag\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(27)</sup></button>. Naby hom lê sy <b>passer</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.21771,0.820832,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"passer\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button>.","t01-09-5":"Karel <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.270084,0.730102,0.009987,0.011137\" data-n=\"23\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(23)</sup></button> hou sy boek in sy hand, hy maak dit oop om sy les weer te lees. Hy het, soos elke leerling, ’n <b>inkpot</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.241456,0.717982,0.011318,0.009826\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"inkpot\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button> voor hom. Hy is gehoorsaam.","t01-10-1":"10. — By die tafel langsaan is <b>Lodewyk</b>, <b>Antonius</b> en <b>Paulus</b>. Lodewyk sê sy les <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.365291,0.645922,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"les\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button> op en antwoord op die <b>vrae</b> van die onderwyser. Antonius <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.329117,0.630855,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button> is baie onoplettend, die onderwyser straf hom selfs somtyds. Paulus <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.334665,0.600721,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button> is ’n goeie <b>maat</b>, vriendelik en hulpvaardig. Hy is baie oplettend.","t01-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Die slegte leerlinge.</span>","t01-11-1":"11. — Agter Hendrik sit <b>Georg</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543276,0.87455,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"Georg\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button>. Hy is nie ’n slegte kêrel nie, maar hy is <b>praterig</b>, onoplettend en baldadig. Sy <b>ligsinnigheid</b> en <b>ongehoorsaamheid</b> veroorsaak <b>steurnis</b> tydens die les en dikwels verdien hy ’n streng <b>waarskuwing</b>. Sy <b>kladskrif</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.486906,0.885686,0.009987,0.010809\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"kladskrif\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button> is vuil, hy <b>bemors</b> dit met ink met sy <b>pen</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.513316,0.936456,0.011762,0.008516\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"pen\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button>, daarom gebruik hy altyd sy <b>uitveër</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.478695,0.859155,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"uitveër\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button>; sy <b>boeksak</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454949,0.912217,0.010431,0.012119\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"boeksak\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button> is geskeur, want hy is baie slordig. Waarom bring hy sy <b>potloodhouer</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.496671,0.864723,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"potloodhouer\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button> na die klaskamer van die lewende tale toe?","t01-11-2":"Sy buurman Edmund <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.53573,0.800852,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button> hou nie van hom nie. Hy is weliswaar ’n bietjie traag, maar hy is stil en rustig. Hy praat nie; maar in plaas van te luister, lees hy liewer die <b>verhale</b> uit sy <b>leesboek</b>.","t01-11-3":"Die derde leerling van hierdie bank is <b>Lodewyk</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.483577,0.767114,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"Lodewyk\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button>. Hy is vlytig. Hy skryf op ’n wit <b>vel papier</b>. Voor hom het hy sy <b>vloeipapier</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.432091,0.739928,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"vloeipapier\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button> neergelê.","t01-12-1":"12. — Die leerlinge van die tweede bank, links van die onderwyser, is baie jonk. Die eerste, die klein <b>Emiel</b>, kan nog nie baie goed skryf nie, hy bring sy <b>lei</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.45162,0.655421,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"42\" title=\"lei\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(42)</sup></button>, sy <b>griffel</b> en sy <b>spons</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.627252,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"43\" title=\"spons\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(43)</sup></button> saam.","t01-12-2":"Langs hom is <b>August</b> en <b>Bernard</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.591549,0.011984,0.009499\" data-n=\"44\" title=\"Bernard\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(44)</sup></button>. Hierdie een werk goed, maar sy <b>kleredrag</b> is baie slordig.","t01-13-1":"13. — Agter hulle sit drie <b>luiaards</b>. <b>Albert</b> leer sy lesse nie. <b>Jakobus</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.629161,0.611857,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"47\" title=\"Jakobus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(47)</sup></button> slaap in plaas van te luister. Sy <b>luiheid</b> besorg hom <b>verwyte</b> en selfs <b>strawwe</b>. Ten slotte is <b>Christiaan</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.679982,0.61153,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"48\" title=\"Christiaan\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(48)</sup></button> te ligsinnig. Hy <b>gedra</b> hom sleg en doen glad geen moeite om hom te verbeter nie.","t01-14-1":"14. — Sy bure, daarenteen, is welopgevoed. <b>Ernst</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699956,0.702588,0.007989,0.010809\" data-n=\"51\" title=\"Ernst\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(51)</sup></button> hou van orde en reëlmaat, hy gebruik altyd sy <b>liniaal</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.692632,0.793318,0.008877,0.010809\" data-n=\"50\" title=\"liniaal\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(50)</sup></button> en sy <b>potlood</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.671993,0.744841,0.010209,0.009171\" data-n=\"49\" title=\"potlood\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(49)</sup></button>. Hy is ’n <b>dagskolier</b>.","t01-14-2":"<b>Frans</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.780293,0.754012,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"52\" title=\"Frans\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(52)</sup></button> is ’n <b>koshuisleerling</b>, hy dra ’n uniform, eet en slaap in die liseum. Hy is ’n goeie <b>maat</b>.","t01-14-3":"Maurits maak sy <b>potlood</b> skerp met sy <b>knipmes</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.786951,0.886341,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"56\" title=\"knipmes\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(56)</sup></button>, hy is baie sorgsaam.","t01-14-4":"Hy bring al sy boeke saam, sy <b>grammatika</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.732801,0.892892,0.009543,0.010481\" data-n=\"55\" title=\"grammatika\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(55)</sup></button>, sy <b>notaboekie</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.709055,0.857845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"54\" title=\"notaboekie\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(54)</sup></button>, en selfs ’n <b>skryfonderlegger</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.762761,0.880118,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"53\" title=\"skryfonderlegger\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(53)</sup></button>. Sy <b>skooltas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.930537,0.91451,0.010209,0.010809\" data-n=\"57\" title=\"skooltas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(57)</sup></button> staan op die vloer agter hom.","t01-14-5":"Die twee tafels agterin die klaskamer word deur <b>goeie leerlinge</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.337772,0.507042,0.008433,0.010809\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"goeie leerlinge\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button> beset.","t01-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Tekene en musiek.</span>","t01-15-1":"15. — In die <b>tekenkamer</b> is daar sierlike <b>modelle</b> teen die muur opgehang en ’n <b>lamp</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.975144,0.45922,0.009765,0.010809\" data-n=\"62\" title=\"lamp\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(62)</sup></button> met ’n <b>skerm</b>, wat aan die plafon hang. Die <b>onderwyser</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.81447,0.575827,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"60\" title=\"onderwyser\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(60)</sup></button> is baie geduldig, hy verbeter die <b>tekeninge</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891034,0.610219,0.007324,0.009826\" data-n=\"61\" title=\"tekeninge\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(61)</sup></button> van die leerlinge en leer hulle om ’n <b>borsbeeld</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.976476,0.514248,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"59\" title=\"borsbeeld\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(59)</sup></button> na die natuur te teken.","t01-16-1":"16. — Die <b>musieklokaal</b> lyk baie interessant. Daarin leer ’n mens <b>musiek</b> lees, die <b>toonlere</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.753884,0.423845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"67\" title=\"toonlere\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(67)</sup></button> solfeer wat op die <b>notebalk</b> geskryf is (do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si = C. D. E. F. G. A. B.), die <b>sleutels</b> ken en bekoorlike <b>melodieë</b> sing. Die musiekstukke word op die <b>lessenaar</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.640257,0.466099,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"65\" title=\"lessenaar\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(65)</sup></button> gesit. Een van die leerlinge <b>speel klavier</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.758766,0.510645,0.010652,0.010809\" data-n=\"64\" title=\"speel klavier\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(64)</sup></button> en die <b>musiekonderwyser</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699512,0.461513,0.009099,0.010809\" data-n=\"66\" title=\"musiekonderwyser\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(66)</sup></button> <b>slaan die maat</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.725477,0.447101,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"68\" title=\"slaan die maat\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(68)</sup></button>.","t01-17-1":"17. — Ons begin ’n hoek van die <b>werkplek</b> vir <b>handearbeid</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"handearbeid\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button> sien, waar die seuns mag leer om hout te skaaf en yster te vyl. Dit bestaan nie in alle liseums nie.","t01-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Die lokaal vir die wetenskappe.</span>","t01-18-1":"18. — Die onderwyser van wiskunde leer die leerlinge <b>meetkunde, rekenkunde, berekening</b> en die <b>metrieke stelsel</b>. Ons sien op die bord die vernaamste meetkundige figure: die <b>sirkel</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.019633,0.658661,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"sirkel\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, die <b>vierkant</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052468,0.626557,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"vierkant\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, die <b>driehoek</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.049811,0.67077,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"driehoek\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>, die <b>lyn</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.035173,0.739874,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"lyn\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-18-2":"Ons sien ook ’n <b>bewerking</b>, dit is nie ’n <b>optelling</b> nie, ook nie ’n <b>aftrekking</b> nie, ook nie ’n <b>vermenigvuldiging</b> nie, dit is wel ’n <b>deling</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.065565,0.676005,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"deling\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>.","t01-19-1":"19. — Op die bord van die metrieke stelsel sien ons: die <b>meter</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052217,0.380286,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"meter\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, die <b>weegskaal</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.015161,0.379639,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"weegskaal\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button> en haar <b>gewigte</b>, die <b>liter</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.059978,0.343932,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"liter\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, die <b>dekaliter</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.013372,0.258796,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"dekaliter\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, die <b>desiliter</b> en die <b>kubieke meter</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.03224,0.324944,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"kubieke meter\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-19-2":"Die leerlinge studeer ook <b>natuurwetenskap</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"muurplate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button>, dierkunde <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.124098,0.290533,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"dierkunde\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, plantkunde <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.132317,0.3652,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"plantkunde\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, geologie <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.127443,0.431354,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"geologie\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> en <b>geskiedenis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"muurplate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button>.","t01-19-3":"In die kas is die toestelle vir <b>fisika</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"kas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> en vir <b>chemie</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230138,0.5755,0.009321,0.010481\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"chemie\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button>.","t01-19-4":"Op die kas is: ’n <b>bol</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.189525,0.419915,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"bol\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>, ’n <b>keël</b> en ’n <b>aardbol</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.175322,0.387815,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"aardbol\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>.","t01-19-5":"Bo die tabelle hang ’n <b>kaart</b> wat die vyf werelddele voorstel: <b>Europa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.161802,0.143808,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Europa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>Asië</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.20951,0.166394,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"g\" title=\"Asië\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(g)</sup></button>, <b>Afrika</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.155821,0.230267,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"Afrika\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>Amerika</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.073486,0.101258,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button><button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.084585,0.148741,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup> en <b>Oseanië</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.209077,0.256781,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"h\" title=\"Oseanië\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(h)</sup></button> en die twee groot oseane, die <b>Stille Oseaan</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036213,0.146461,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"Stille Oseaan\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> en die <b>Atlantiese Oseaan</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.116538,0.161832,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"Atlantiese Oseaan\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>. <span class=\"fil\"></span>"},"noto":{"t01-noto-1":"(*) Vir die <i>doopname</i> word aanbeveel om hulle ook volgens die Latynse vorm oor te skryf. Dit is die enigste manier om ontelbare afwykings te ontkom. Hoe sou ’n mens trouens kies tussen <i>Giovanni, Jean,</i> <i>Johann, Jan, Hans, John, Ivan,</i> ens.? Sal ons ’n aparte woordeboek vir die doopname maak? Laat ons uit die Latyn hulle nominatief put en sê: <b>Ioannes, Ioanna; Iulius, Iulia; Iakobus; Andreas; Lukas.</b> (Volledige Gram.)."}}
